==Icelandic==

===Verb===
'''brenna''' (''[[strong declension]]:'' [[brann]], [[brunnu]] – [[brunnið]])

# {{intransitive|lang=is}} to [[burn]], to be [[on fire]]

====Derived terms====
*[[brunninn]] {{m}}, [[brunnin]] {{f}}, [[brunnið]] {{n}}
*[[brenna við]] (to get [[burned]])
*: ''Maturinn '''brann við'''.''
*:: The food '''got burned'''.
*[[vilja brenna við]] (to [[tend to happen]])
*: ''Það '''vill brenna við'''.''
*:: It '''tends to happen'''.''
*[[brenna í skinninu]] (to be [[raring]] to go)
*: ''Hann '''brennur í skinninu'''.''
*:: He's '''raring to go'''.''
*[[láta sér ekki allt fyrir brjósti brenna]] (to be not afraid of anything)

===Verb===
'''brenna''' (+{{accusative}}/+{{dat}}) (''[[weak declension]]:'' [[brenndi]] – [[brennt]])

# (+ {{accusative}}) {{transitive|lang=is}} to [[burn]], to [[set on fire]]
#: ''Ég '''brenndi''' mig á fingrinum!''
#:: I '''burnt''' my finger!
# (+ {{dat}}) {{transitive|lang=is}} to heat up with
#: ''Að '''brenna''' [[kol]]um.''
#:: To '''heat up with''' [[coal]]s.

====Derived terms====
*[[brenndur]] {{m}}, [[brennd]] {{f}}, [[brennt]] {{n}}

===Noun===
'''brenna''' {{f}} ([[brennu|brenn-u]], [[brennur|brenn-ur]])

# a [[bonfire]]
#: ''Hvenær byrjar '''brennan'''?''
#:: When does the '''bonfire''' start?
# a [[burning]]

